.TH STOP-MU2EDAQ-CFOCONTROL.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-CFOControl t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
stop-mu2edaq-cfocontrol.sh \- no-op stop script for the one-shot CFOControl tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stop\-mu2edaq\-cfocontrol.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Standardised Mu2e control-room stop script, run by
.BR "crs-app stop cfocontrol" .
.B CFOControl.py
is a one-shot client with no persistent process, PID file or temporary file,
so this script prints a two-line notice and exits.
It does not signal any process and does not cancel a macro already sent to
the MacroMaker.
.SH OPTIONS
None; arguments are ignored.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Always 0.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
\&./stop\-mu2edaq\-cfocontrol.sh
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-cfocontrol.sh (1),
.BR CFOControl.py (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
